UUID: a2c094bf-5e11-3b4b-865f-1130f1fed788
Mixture of two optical brighteners. Only input of mentioned substances is taken into account.
Location: Data used has no specific geographical origin (two examples included already into the database chosen). Data are used as European average data.
Technology: equal split to two substances without any further inputs/outputs
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: see technology 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a2c094bf-5e11-3b4b-865f-1130f1fed788.xml</text>
